
                    **About the Wacky EC Doc directory**
Okers..  For easy reading, in the event that this directory gets
filled up with documents, have the number of the document first, in 
two-digit format (in case we end up with more then 10), followed
by the name of your document, the . bit, and then the first initial(s)
of whoever wrote it.  

  Just a suggestion for easy reading.   

               Walker

Addendem:  
When changing the Connections or Faqs files, please alter 
line 2 in said file to reflect who and when the last update was.
-- Tabitha Feb 9 95
